| File | Purpose | When to Use |
|------|---------|-------------|
| `system_specs.md` | Game rules and formulas | Before implementing any game mechanic |
| `current_state.md` | Feature tracking | Before adding new features |
| `.cursorrules` | Coding standards | During all development |
| `state.config` | Runtime constants | For all game balance values |

---

## Don'ts

- ❌ Don't import anchor files (`.md`) in code
- ❌ Don't hardcode numeric values for game balance
- ❌ Don't mutate state directly
- ❌ Don't skip null checks
- ❌ Don't create circular dependencies
- ❌ Don't duplicate skill IDs across classes
- ❌ Don't add features without updating `current_state.md`
- ❌ Don't change formulas without updating `system_specs.md`
